{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XcOh7pD52M1793082262.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>信置表示，早前中標洪水橋片區用地將提供物流中心、公園及住宅，強調對北都非常有信心，任何北都項目也會研究。</p><p></p><p>信和置業主席黃永光說︰「北都除了創科，除了大學城、醫院，住宅也是很重要，中央政府及香港政府均希望香港人住好些。我們第一塊洪水橋項目，主要就是有公園、有高科技物流中心，以及有住宅。當然我們也在觀望，其他如新田、河套、洪水橋、粉嶺等，接下來政府有不同北都板塊推出，我們屆時也會研究。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:20.027984+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:15.241001+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:25.647964+00:00","content_hash":"0b6a37173feb5501442c8597ccab04336a3713b5b76bdcc59d13687f492644d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:20.027984+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}